  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clearing for Results IV - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The current phase of the project is implemented by the Cambodia Mine Action and Victim Assistance Authority, with support from Australia, Korea, New Zealand, and Luxembourg.
It aims to clear and release mine-contaminated land, support mine-impacted communities, and strengthen Cambodia&#x2019;s mine action management. It is the final year of the phase IV  of the Clearing for Results Project.</narrative>
  </description>
